`)}}}},wht=["DT-DP-2"],vht=["Role of prototyping in the design process","Physical and digital models and mock-ups","Testing functionality and usability of prototypes","Gathering stakeholder feedback to refine designs","Evaluating a design against the design brief"],xht={id:"design_and_technology/2025/q11",version:1,variants:1,syllabusTopics:[...wht],learningTopics:vht,generate(t){return{question:"Outline the role of prototyping in the development of a design project.",sampleAnswer:["Prototyping allows designers to bring ideas to life by creating a physical or","digital model of the design before final production.","","It enables testing of functionality and usability, allowing early identification","of problems and collection of feedback from stakeholders. This saves time and","cost by resolving issues before the final product is manufactured.","","In other words, the prototype gives the designer something concrete to evaluate","against the design brief before committing to the final solution."].join(`
`),marks:2}}},kht=["DT-IET-4"],Tht=["Privacy and informed consent in data collection","Security of stored personal information","Ethical use of personal health and location data","Data minimisation in digital product design"],Aht={id:"design_and_technology/2025/q12",version:1,variants:1,syllabusTopics:[...kht],learningTopics:Tht,generate(t){return{question:["A design team is building a fitness app that records each user's location, heart","rate and sleep patterns.","","Describe ONE ethical issue the team must address when collecting and storing this","personal information."].join(`
`),sampleAnswer:["A 3-mark answer names the issue, explains why it matters for *this* app, and","states what the designers should do about it.","","**Sample answer (privacy and informed consent):**","","Location, heart-rate and sleep records reveal where a person lives and exercises and","details about their health, so users have a right to control who sees them. If the","data were shared with advertisers or insurers without permission, or leaked in a","breach, users could be stalked, targeted or treated unfairly. The team should ask","for clear, informed consent in plain language, collect only the data the app","actually needs, encrypt what it stores, and let users view and delete their records.","","Other acceptable issues include data security (protecting the stored data from","hackers) and honest use of data (not selling it or using it for purposes the user","did not agree to). Whichever issue is chosen, link it to the specific data this app","collects."].join(`
