`)},{id:"year11-minimum-units",question:"Under NESA's standard pattern of study, how many units do students normally study in Year 11 Preliminary?",choices:["8 units","10 units","12 units","14 units"],correctChoiceIndex:2,explanation:["Under NESA's standard pattern of study, students normally study at least 12 units","in Year 11 Preliminary.","","That is one reason Year 11 and Year 12 pattern rules should not be treated as","identical."].join(`
